<h1>DbnFetch</h1>
<p class="lead">
    The <code>dbnf</code> command lists a DbnSync archive, downloads its raw files, and exports bars, rebuilt order
    books and, for futures, back-adjusted continuous series, as CSV, Parquet, JSON Lines, DBN or NinjaTrader 8.
</p>

